WEBVTT

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.610
Right now, these are the only cards you have?

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:38.980
Yes.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:40.480
Hmm...

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.990
Hmm...

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.790
Just look at the actual cards.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.050
I told ya, it messes with

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.930
<i>my sense of realism!</i>

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.290
<i>Man, you just don't get—</i>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:02.300
<b>Sakura's Thrilling Aquarium Visit</b>

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.040
<i>And the dreams?</i>

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.630
I still sometimes have them.

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Even when you aren't asleep?</i>

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:12.310
Two days ago, she suddenly passed 
out on me, too. It freaked me out.

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.720
Thanks for holding me up, Kero-chan.

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:19.240
Well, I got double snacks the 
next day, so it's all good.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.730
<i>Also, the pictures are still 
missing from my cards.</i>

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:24.740
<i>I still have no idea why.</i>

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:28.910
<i>But it's not as if anything really 
troublesome has happened...</i>

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:33.450
Something happens, and you turn 
that something into a card.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.440
That part is the same as when 
you gathered the Clow Cards.

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.040
But...

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.320
We still don't know why 
these things are happening.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:43.760
Right.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.710
Hey, it'll be fine.

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:47.350
If it comes to it...

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:51.050
Ya got me, too!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.410
What's with that look?!

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.320
Tell me even the smallest details.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:00.150
Anything you've noticed, 
anything that's made you curious.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.900
Okay!

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.160
Sakura, the time.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.480
I need to be going soon!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.750
Talk to you later, Yue-san!

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:12.630
<i>Take care.</i>

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.720
I will. Bye.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:15.840
<b>Yue-san 
Kero-chan 
Call ended</b>

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.870
Don't forget my souvenir!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:24.340
I hope he likes the lunch.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.510
Yeah.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.820
I'm heading out!

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.090
Have a good time.

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.030
<i>You aren't going with her?</i>

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.500
No, today isn't really the day...

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.810
<i>What is it that she's doing?</i>

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.350
Goin' out with that kid.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.790
I thought you'd either happily 
go with her or follow her.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.990
Well, I thought about it, but...

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.370
<i>Don't go with her, okay, Kero-chan?</i>

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:56.240
Why not? It'll be a great photo op.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.690
<i>I would love to take advantage 
of that, as well.</i>

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:02.120
<i>If I could, I'd really...</i>

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.520
<i>really...</i>

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:07.080
<i>really love to do that!</i>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.140
<i>I really, really would...</i>

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.140
She's dyin' to.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.380
<i>But those two don't have many 
opportunities to be alone.</i>

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.510
<i>And now, they finally have a date.</i>

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.900
I guess, but if somethin' 
weird happens again...

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.510
<i>If it does, Li-kun will be there for her!</i>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.250
So, that's why I decided not to.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:30.860
I see.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:34.560
But, man, Spinny hasn't been 
answerin' my calls,

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.210
and I don't wanna be bored.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.490
Hey, Yue... Play an online game with me.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.270
Aw, c'mon!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.110
I'm so glad the weather's nice!

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.880
I've gotta hurry!

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.300
I want to get there before our meeting time.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.610
Syaoran-kun!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.380
Sorry...

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.760
I made you wait...

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.690
Nah, I got here too early.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.040
It's still twelve minutes 
before our meeting time.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:34.980
Don't worry about it.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:36.410
Okay.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.820
That looks good.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.010
Huh?

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.230
Your outfit.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.480
T-Tomoyo-chan picked it out for me.

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:48.740
R-Really?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.950
<b>Aquarium</b>

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.850
We were going to catch the next bus, 
but let's take this one.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:54.790
Sure.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:04.770
What is it?

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.510
Nothing!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:20.270
<b>Tomoeda Aquarium</b>

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.260
I never knew there was an aquarium out here.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:24.760
I've been here before with Yukito-san. 
And with Tomoyo-chan, too.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.160
But since I've never been here with you...

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.040
Oh, hang on.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.530
Here.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:35.150
You're sure?

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:35.920
Yeah.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.370
My dad got them from 
someone at the university.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.630
And, um...

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.550
Go with someone you like.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.320
...he said.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:46.510
Someone you like...

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:53.710
Hey, that boy and girl are all red!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.130
They must like each other.

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.360
Like each other?

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.190
L-Let's go.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.720
But why are they red? Why?

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.660
Y-Yeah!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.430
Wow, look at them float!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:31.000
Jellyfish are so pretty, aren't they?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:35.470
But some are venomous, so you 
have to be careful in the ocean.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.340
Syaoran-kun, you know 
a lot about them, huh?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:42.220
Not really... Meiling got stung 
by one at the beach, once.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.720
Huh? Was she okay?

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:49.120
It wasn't that bad, but she just kept crying.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:56.100
It must have hurt her a lot...

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.270
I don't think she was hurting,

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:00.380
so much as crying out of desperation.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.270
Sorry, I forgot to turn my phone off.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.370
Don't worry about it.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:08.310
Well...

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.840
<b>Meiling Li</b>

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.840
<b>
You're on a date, 
so be sure to take the lead! 
Don't be all shy the whole time!</b>

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.170
What's wrong?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:19.090
Nothing... Just a message from Meiling.

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:20.480
Oh, okay!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:25.290
She doesn't have magical powers, 
but she's oddly perceptive.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.730
Considering when she messages, it's almost 
like she's watching, somewhere.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:33.140
She always sends me messages 
at just the right time, too.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:36.040
And she always calls when 
I want to hear her voice

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.480
or I wonder what she's up to.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.490
Yeah?

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.760
I'll send her a message later, too.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:53.630
<b>Penguins 

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:51.800
There's a penguin show!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.910
Want to see it?

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:53.640
Can we?!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.390
Sure.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.320
I wanted to see it, too.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:59.060
Is the penguin show this way?

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:02.130
No, the sunfish flaming-hoop 
jump arena is over there.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.930
Could you wait here for a sec?

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:04.510
Sure.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.140
Do you need any help?

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:10.610
Yes, we're trying to get to the penguin show.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.240
We're heading there, too. 
How about you come along with us?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.090
Thanks. We'll come with you, then.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.270
Sure. This way.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:25.790
<b>Route</b>

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:21.940
They want to see the penguin show, too.

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.180
Can they come with us?

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.630
S-Sure!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.780
Thank you.

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.950
I didn't know you could speak 
English, Syaoran-kun!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.700
Well, I did live in Hong Kong.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.120
That's amazing!

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:36.510
I'm terrible at English...

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.290
Want me to teach you? 
The stuff I know, at least.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.560
Would you?

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:43.810
I might not be too helpful, though.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:47.300
Thanks! I'd really appreciate it!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.310
What a cute couple, huh?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.940
Yeah, they really are.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.890
Wow.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.290
They're amazing, aren't they?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:04.870
Yeah.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.280
Wow! Amazing!

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:08.280
Did you see that?

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:09.020
Yeah!

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:11.540
This was where the Watery 
Clow Card appeared, too.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.910
During a show.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:16.390
You captured it in a crowd like this?

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:18.990
No, I waited until that night.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.680
This is open at night?

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.260
I snuck in.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.020
Gotcha.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.390
The penguins were so cute!

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:35.540
They were amazing.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.750
It was here!

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:41.740
Syaoran-kun, hurry up!

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:46.750
Hey, I think different fish 
were in here, last time!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.300
But the tea room is still there.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.280
Maybe it's my imagination, 
but it looks the same.

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:55.430
The strawberry milk shaved ice 
I had here was so good...

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:01.240
I'm kind of glad to see it's still the same.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.420
Oh, but...

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:07.310
When I came with Yukito-san, 
Watery showed up here, too.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.000
Huh?

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.450
What is it?

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:12.900
M-My brother...

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:20.190
You're working here again, Onii-chan?

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.790
Filling in.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:27.550
I-Is Yukito-san with you?

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:30.920
He volunteers to read picture 
books to kids in the evening.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.060
O-Oh...

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.610
C-Can we order now?

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.520
Ready, Syaoran-kun?

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:42.030
Do you want the strawberry 
milk shaved ice, too?

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:42.930
Sure.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.800
Two strawberry milk shaved ices!

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.410
Coming right up.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:11:59.590
Sorry!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.900
I wasn't sure how I should look at him.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.240
Oh, right.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.560
I didn't... I didn't greet him.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:08.980
I'm sorry.

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:11.310
He's been grumpy for a while now.

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.450
My attitude could've been better, too.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.210
Besides...

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:22.220
Right now, um... I...

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.150
I mean...

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:29.350
I want to... g-g...

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:31.190
Go...

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:33.600
Go?

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.260
Go out wi—

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:52.790
Sakura!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.320
Sakura!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.900
<i>It's just like the time with the Clow Cards.</i>

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.100
<b>Fire Hydrant</b>

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.400
<b>Open in Emergencies</b>

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:35.940
Are you okay?

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.510
Y-Yeah.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:41.810
Listen...

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:45.210
My foot got caught in a swirl of water, 
just like when Watery appeared.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.830
Exactly the same?

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:52.590
But it didn't have the presence 
of a Clow Card.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.770
Our lunch!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.120
I'll go get it.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.000
Syaoran-kun...

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.570
<i>Oh, my! That really happened?</i>

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:21.680
Yeah. It really was just like 
when Watery appeared.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.420
You weren't hurt, were you?

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:28.140
I'm fine, but the lunch I made...

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:37.000
<i>That's too bad.</i>

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:40.640
Yeah. And the rolled omelets 
came out so well, too.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.400
The next time you go out together, 
you can make him some more.

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:48.570
<i>You can see him at any time now, after all.</i>

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:53.700
You're right.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:58.640
<i>Still, could that have been 
the work of a new card?</i>

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.410
I think it was.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.410
Are you going back to find out?

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:06.550
It would be terrible if 
another tank was broken.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:12.290
Then, I shall have to act, as well, 
just like back then.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:16.850
What's up?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.560
You look beautiful, Sakura-chan!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:35.440
I-It's embarrassing, with all 
these people here!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:41.760
Don't worry! These are all professionals!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.280
R-Right...

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.390
That looks great on you, Li-kun!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:58.560
I heard that you no longer had your 
ceremonial outfit from last time,

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:03.260
so I created a new design, 
with its image in mind!

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:06.440
Did I really have to change, too?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.790
But this is the perfect opportunity.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.710
You both have to do it together.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.220
Opportunity?

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.940
Yes, opportunity.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:17.050
It looks really good on you.

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.320
It does?

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.590
Uh-huh! It makes you look 
more mature, somehow!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.290
I-It does?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.410
Uh-huh!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.130
That's my best shot!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.800
Me, too... Film me, too!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.700
Have a good night.

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:39.550
Thanks. Same to you.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.820
Are you sure we should do this?

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.820
This is how I got in before.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.860
Well, not just here...

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.690
When you were workin' on the Clow 
Cards and the Sakura Cards,

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:57.040
you had to sneak in everywhere, pretty much.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.820
This is nothin' new.

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.950
Someone in there?

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:06.330
They're comin'!

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:07.660
I know.

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:09.870
<i>Lucid!</i>

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:25.600
I'm sure I heard voices talking over here...

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.180
Weird.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.390
Looks like he's gone.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:35.310
Whew, this card sure is a winner!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:38.930
We can't use it for long, though.

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:41.320
Let's go, before the guard comes back.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:43.060
Yeah.

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:50.380
This spot seems different.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.330
It's the same kinda place as 
where ya captured Watery!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.420
Here it comes!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:11.050
It's not... water?

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:15.810
Sakura-chan!

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:19.580
Sakura!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.480
Follow her!

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:21.330
Yeah!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.090
<i>Gravitation!</i>

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.440
<i>Flight!</i>

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.170
She's outside.

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:07.710
<i>Gale!</i>

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:21.920
Sakura!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.420
Whoa!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:24.520
Cerberus!

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:25.430
What?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.590
How'd she do it last time?

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:28.190
Last time?

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.640
How did she capture Watery?!

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.410
W-Well...

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.650
Th-That's it!

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.760
She froze it in the freezer!

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.600
Oh, but the freezer is inside!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.670
<i>Ice god, come forth!</i>

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.540
Now, Sakura!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:03.760
Right

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:09.630
<i>Force without master,</i>

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:13.480
<i>heed the call of my Staff of Dreams, 
and become my power!</i>

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.350
<i>Secure!</i>

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.380
Are you okay?

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.300
Y-Yeah.

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.470
You're not hurt?

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.210
No...

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.210
Your magic is amazing, Syaoran-kun!

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.750
Then, it really was a card, huh?

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.470
Yeah.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.720
<b>Spiral</b>

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.890
"Spiral"...

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:49.710
Spiral.

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.180
So it wasn't a water-type...

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:55.350
No, and I already have the Aqua card, anyway.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.460
Is anyone injured?

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:01.570
No.

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.520
Nope!

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:05.360
Thank goodness.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.890
And...

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.740
Arranging to film from the air 
was the right call!

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:19.280
Film me, too!

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:24.380
<i>Oh, you ran into Toya?</i>

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:25.870
Yeah...

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:27.070
<i>Was everything all right?</i>

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:29.850
We didn't get into a fight or anything,

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:33.390
but he just kept glaring at Syaoran-kun.

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:36.060
<i>What a trying big brother, huh?</i>

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.320
He sure is.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.620
And right after that, the tank...

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.030
<i>Yeah, I saw it on the news.</i>

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.190
<i>You weren't hurt, were you?</i>

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:48.950
I wasn't! But it really was 
just like last time.

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:52.040
<i>Except you were with 
someone else today, right?</i>

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:57.070
<i>It's nice that you could go to the 
aquarium with Syaoran-kun.</i>

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:01.180
Y-Yeah!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:04.550
<i>Anyway, I'll ask if it would be 
okay for you to come watch</i>

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:06.430
<i>next time I read the kids picture books.</i>

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:07.920
Thank you!

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:11.180
<i>You must be tired after 
everything, so late at night.</i>

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:12.570
<i>Get some rest, okay?</i>

00:22:12.570 --> 00:22:15.270
Same to you. Goodnight.

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:16.290
<i>Night.</i>

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:22.650
I see... I'm the coolest 
guy in the world, huh?

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:35.290
<i>A lot happened, but today was a good day.</i>

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:12.400
Hidey-howdy-ho!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:12.970
<b>Leave It to Kero-chan!</b>

00:24:12.960 --> 00:24:16.160
Did ya do your homework? 
Time for "Leave It to Kero-chan!"

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:18.970
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:18.970
<b>K</b>

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:19.350
We'll be lookin' at another 
battle costume, today!

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.820
The hat and skirt have dots 
attached to the ends.

00:24:21.820 --> 00:24:25.440
It's the same concept as the last time 
she captured a card at the aquarium.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:28.170
Everythin' is waterproof material.

00:24:28.170 --> 00:24:32.030
I wish I could've changed, too. 
I had a costume, last time...

00:24:31.490 --> 00:24:32.490
<b>Don't get disheartened...</b>

00:24:32.490 --> 00:24:37.280
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:32.490 --> 00:24:37.280
<b>K</b>

00:24:32.710 --> 00:24:35.980
The dudes workin' at the aquarium 
still seem to be doin' well.

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:38.770
Stayin' healthy is what matters most! 
Don't catch a cold, okay?

00:24:38.770 --> 00:24:39.990
Ta-ta!

00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:42.710
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:24:40.520 --> 00:24:44.890
Akiho-chan comes over to visit, 
but suddenly she falls asleep.

00:24:44.890 --> 00:24:46.590
Is it because of a card?

00:24:46.590 --> 00:24:47.830
I've gotta capture it.

00:24:48.570 --> 00:24:51.120
Next time, "Sakura and the Sleep Labyrinth."

00:24:49.380 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Sakura and the Sleep Labyrinth</b>

00:24:51.560 --> 00:24:54.610
Say it with me: "Release!"

00:24:55.010 --> 00:25:00.010
<b>End</b>
